{"id":"00fc37c0aebf8fda","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-zfc-model8-modal-logic-of-forcing.md","title":"ZFC Model8 Modal Logic Of Forcing","display":"df-zfc-model8-modal-logic-of-forcing — ZFC Model8 Modal Logic Of Forcing","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-model8-modal-logic-of-forcing","aliases":["58-df-zfc-model8-modal-logic-of-forcing"],"display":"df-zfc-model8-modal-logic-of-forcing — ZFC Model8 Modal Logic Of Forcing","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-forcing8-forcing-extension.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-generic-filter.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[58-df-zfc-inner2-transitive-model]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-model8-modal-logic-of-forcing"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-model8-modal-logic-of-forcing</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-model8-modal-logic-of-forcing — ZFC Model8 Modal Logic Of Forcing"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"006f3fc193351ef4\" href=\"?note=006f3fc193351ef4\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-zfc-forcing8-forcing-extension.md\">../batch07/58-df-zfc-forcing8-forcing-extension.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"85bf4cca0e5f1662\" href=\"?note=85bf4cca0e5f1662\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-generic-filter.md\">../batch14/58-df-generic-filter.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b8a669eb1f18f3f5\" href=\"?note=b8a669eb1f18f3f5\" title=\"58-df-zfc-inner2-transitive-model\">58-df-zfc-inner2-transitive-model</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W,\\operatorname{Prop},\\mathrm{ML}(\\operatorname{Prop}),\\sigma,\\varphi,\\psi\\in V\">\\(W,\\operatorname{Prop},\\mathrm{ML}(\\operatorname{Prop}),\\sigma,\\varphi,\\psi\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ML}(\\operatorname{Prop})\">\\(\\mathrm{ML}(\\operatorname{Prop})\\)</span> is the least set containing <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Prop}\">\\(\\operatorname{Prop}\\)</span> and closed under <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\">\\(\\neg\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\land\">\\(\\land\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\">\\(\\Box\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak W_{\\in}\">\\(\\mathfrak W_{\\in}\\)</span> is the canonical membership structure with universe <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\)</span> is the forcing-order predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{Prop},\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\{\\in\\}))\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{Prop},\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\{\\in\\}))\\)</span> is a substitution (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInner2TransitiveModel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInner2TransitiveModel}_S\\)</span> is the transitive-ZFC-model predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"b8a669eb1f18f3f5\" href=\"?note=b8a669eb1f18f3f5\" title=\"58-df-zfc-inner2-transitive-model\">58-df-zfc-inner2-transitive-model</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Generic}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Generic}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8ForcingExtension}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8ForcingExtension}_S\\)</span> are genericity and forcing extension (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"85bf4cca0e5f1662\" href=\"?note=85bf4cca0e5f1662\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-generic-filter.md\">../batch14/58-df-generic-filter.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"006f3fc193351ef4\" href=\"?note=006f3fc193351ef4\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-zfc-forcing8-forcing-extension.md\">../batch07/58-df-zfc-forcing8-forcing-extension.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ModalForcingSat}_S(W,\\sigma,\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{ModalForcingSat}_S(W,\\sigma,\\varphi)\\)</span> is defined recursively here</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel8ModalLogicOfForcing}_S:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel8ModalLogicOfForcing}_S:V\\to V\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model8\\text{-}modal\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}satisfaction}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ModalForcingSat}_S(W,\\sigma,p)\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak W_{\\in}\\models\\sigma(p)\\quad(p\\in\\operatorname{Prop}),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{ModalForcingSat}_S(W,\\sigma,\\neg\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{ModalForcingSat}_S(W,\\sigma,\\varphi),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{ModalForcingSat}_S(W,\\sigma,\\varphi\\land\\psi)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ModalForcingSat}_S(W,\\sigma,\\varphi)\\land\\mathrm{ModalForcingSat}_S(W,\\sigma,\\psi),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{ModalForcingSat}_S(W,\\sigma,\\Box\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\\forall P,\\leq_P,G,N\\in V\\;\\bigl(P,\\leq_P\\in W\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{Generic}_S(G,P,W,\\leq_P)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{14em}{}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8ForcingExtension}_S(N,W,G,P)\\to\\mathrm{ModalForcingSat}_S(N,\\sigma,\\varphi)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model8\\text{-}modal\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}satisfaction}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ModalForcingSat}_S(W,\\sigma,p)\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak W_{\\in}\\models\\sigma(p)\\quad(p\\in\\operatorname{Prop}),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{ModalForcingSat}_S(W,\\sigma,\\neg\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{ModalForcingSat}_S(W,\\sigma,\\varphi),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{ModalForcingSat}_S(W,\\sigma,\\varphi\\land\\psi)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ModalForcingSat}_S(W,\\sigma,\\varphi)\\land\\mathrm{ModalForcingSat}_S(W,\\sigma,\\psi),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{ModalForcingSat}_S(W,\\sigma,\\Box\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\\forall P,\\leq_P,G,N\\in V\\;\\bigl(P,\\leq_P\\in W\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{Generic}_S(G,P,W,\\leq_P)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{14em}{}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8ForcingExtension}_S(N,W,G,P)\\to\\mathrm{ModalForcingSat}_S(N,\\sigma,\\varphi)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model8\\text{-}modal\\text{-}logic\\text{-}of\\text{-}forcing} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel8ModalLogicOfForcing}_S(W)\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{ML}(\\operatorname{Prop}):\\mathrm{ZfcInner2TransitiveModel}_S(W)\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{Function}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{Prop},\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\{\\in\\}))\\to\\mathrm{ModalForcingSat}_S(W,\\sigma,\\varphi))\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model8\\text{-}modal\\text{-}logic\\text{-}of\\text{-}forcing} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel8ModalLogicOfForcing}_S(W)\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{ML}(\\operatorname{Prop}):\\mathrm{ZfcInner2TransitiveModel}_S(W)\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{Function}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{Prop},\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\{\\in\\}))\\to\\mathrm{ModalForcingSat}_S(W,\\sigma,\\varphi))\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Modal operators are interpreted recursively over the forcing-extension accessibility relation; a propositional substitution is never applied directly to a composite modal formula.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-zfc-forcing8-forcing-extension.md","st